---- running test_wedge_cap_disabled_by_default
ok - FM_WEDGE_MAX_ESCALATIONS=0 keeps the cap inert and never writes a cap marker
---- running test_wedge_cap_releases_after_genuine_recovery
ok - a genuine recovery clears the cap marker and the re-wedged pane escalates again
---- running test_wedge_cap_reports_gone_endpoint_while_capped
ok - a capped window still reports its gone endpoint exactly once across repeated polls
---- running test_wedge_cap_validates_invalid_overrides
ok - non-integer FM_WEDGE_MAX_ESCALATIONS falls back to 0 and the cap stays inert
